title: AWS RDS Database Instance
agents: aws
catalog: cloud/aws
license: WTFPL
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors AWS RDS database instance metrics via CloudWatch.
 It provides visibility into database performance, storage, and health.

 Monitored metrics:

 - CPU Utilization: Percentage of CPU used

 - Free Storage Space: Available storage (lower bound threshold)

 - Freeable Memory: Available RAM (lower bound threshold)

 - Database Connections: Current connection count

 - Replica Lag: Replication delay for read replicas

 - Read/Write Latency: Average I/O latency in milliseconds

 - Read/Write IOPS: I/O operations per second

 Thresholds can be configured for CPU, storage, memory, connections,
 replica lag, and latency.

discovery:
 One service is created for each RDS instance discovered.
